  "id": "tscs",
  "term": "TSCS",
  "definition": "TSCS stands for transcutaneous spinal cord stimulation, a non-invasive therapy that uses electrical stimulation over the skin to modulate spinal cord networks. It is used mainly to address motor deficits, especially after spinal cord injury, and is also being studied in other conditions that affect movement.",
